      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The peaceful afternoon pool The Gardens in honey. The presence of 12 presences animating the air. Vale Pathfinder, a thoughtful healer, hums softly not far away. Thunder growls nearby. copper leaves tumble on the wind.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-02-28T04:10:06.385297Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-02-28T04-10-06.385297Z</guid>
      <category>say</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The moon blankets above The Arena in the deep stillness. 15 presences populating this domain. Nearby, Cliff Hopefast the musician goes about their craft. thick fog swallows through the air. The world wears copper tones.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-02-28T02:40:47.951146Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-02-28T02-40-47.951146Z</guid>
